Name: html5ever
Short Name: html5ever
URL: https://github.com/servo/html5ever
Version: 0.40.1
Revision: 492f52a02fd07c2321e59ccff90038e26b9c90bc
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py html5ever, history replayed linearly)
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE-APACHE, LICENSE-MIT
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
High-performance browser-grade HTML5 parser

Local Modifications:
The crates (7) live in third_party/html5ever/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/html5ever/ unchanged.

Crates:
  html5ever 0.40.1 third_party/html5ever/html5ever
  markup5ever 0.40.1 third_party/html5ever/markup5ever
  markup5ever_rcdom 0.40.1 third_party/html5ever/markup5ever_rcdom
  tendril 0.5.1 third_party/html5ever/tendril
  tendril-bench  third_party/html5ever/tendril-bench
  web_atoms 0.3.0 third_party/html5ever/web_atoms
  xml5ever 0.40.1 third_party/html5ever/xml5ever
